## Option 2: Using Port Forward (Recommended on AWS EC2)

Since Minikube runs inside the EC2 instance, NodePort is not directly accessible through the EC2 public IP.

Forward the service:

```bash
kubectl port-forward service/food-service 8080:80 -n food-app --address=0.0.0.0
```

Open in browser

```
http://<EC2-PUBLIC-IP>:8080
```

Example

```
http://54.xxx.xxx.xxx:8080
```

