# ❌ Problems Faced and Solutions

## 1. Invalid Container Name

### Error

```
Invalid value: "cafe-site-Madhu"
```

### Cause

Container names must contain lowercase characters only.

### Solution

```
name: cafe-site-madhu
```

---

## 2. ImagePullBackOff

### Cause

Docker image not available or incorrect image name.

### Solution

```bash
docker push madhu934652/cafe-website:v1
```

Update Deployment image.

---

## 3. CreateContainerConfigError

### Error

```
CreateContainerConfigError
```

### Root Cause

Secret was missing.

Describe Pod

```bash
kubectl describe pod <pod-name> -n food-app
```

Output

```
Error: secret "mysql-secret" not found
```

### Fix

```bash
kubectl apply -f k8s/04-secret.yaml
```

Restart Deployment

```bash
kubectl rollout restart deployment/mysql -n food-app
```

📸 Screenshot

```
screenshots/29-secret-error.png
```

---

## 4. Service Endpoints <none>

### Cause

Selector mismatch.

Wrong

```yaml
selector:

 app: food-app
```

Correct

```yaml
selector:

 app: cafe-website
```

Verify

```bash
kubectl get endpoints -n food-app
```

---

## 5. Wrong Target Port

Wrong

```yaml
targetPort: 8080
```

Correct

```yaml
targetPort: 80
```

---

## 6. NodePort Not Accessible

Cause

Minikube networking inside EC2.

Solution

```bash
kubectl port-forward service/food-service 8080:80 -n food-app --address=0.0.0.0
```

